From 2681e8a606041b4bdfd5829d6cb530a1cae846ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SteveDeFacto <5148995+SteveDeFacto@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:58:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] Shared NVMe cache budget ledger: reservations of fixed
 maxima, hard-bounded kinds only, per-host shares <= cap

budget.py (canonical /etc/enclave-rpc-cache/nvme-cache-budget.json, enclave-rpc-nvme-cache-budget/v1):
validate / admit / allocate / verify; flock on <ledger>.lock (budget-only); O_EXCL ownership markers;
interrupted creates adopted, never re-granted; directory entries, missing own files, sparse or grown
files, foreign files and over-share/over-cap ledgers refused. Storage script create/assemble/verify-cap
use it instead of point-in-time inventory measurement; holder config names its reservation
(storage.nvmeBudget) instead of planning estimates. Tests: test_budget.py incl. real-process
concurrency and controls running the previous script (fd0134d) to show its failures; 7 budget + 2
script mutants.
